{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, full-width Shopify section called “The ELEVATE Model”, closely matching the provided reference design.
    
    DESIGN / LAYOUT:
    - Use a full-width background image of a peaceful, dark, misty forest with a natural walking trail, trees, rocks and soft atmospheric lighting.
    - Add a strong dark navy-blue transparent overlay over the entire background image so the image appears muted and atmospheric.
    - The section should have generous vertical spacing and feel premium, calm, spiritual, therapeutic and sophisticated.
    - Desktop layout should have a maximum content width of approximately 560–620px and be positioned slightly left of center, similar to the reference.
    - On mobile, stack everything vertically with comfortable horizontal padding of approximately 24px.
    - Do not use cards or white containers around the content. Everything should sit directly over the background.
    
    HEADER:
    - At the top center of the content area, add a small uppercase eyebrow text:
      “OUR APPROACH”
    - Use a small elegant serif or refined uppercase font.
    - Color: muted warm gold.
    - Add the main heading:
      “The ELEVATE Model”
    - Large elegant serif typography, white/off-white.
    - Center align the heading.
    - Under the heading add:
      “A proprietary seven-step framework that guides every counseling journey from first session to lasting transformation.”
    - Use small, light, muted white/gray text with comfortable line-height.
    - Keep the paragraph relatively narrow so it wraps into approximately two lines on desktop.
    
    SEVEN-STEP CONTENT:
    Create seven vertically stacked steps.
    
    Each step should contain:
    1. A circular badge on the left.
    2. The corresponding letter inside the circle.
    3. The step title on the right.
    4. A short description underneath the title.
    
    The letters must spell vertically:
    
    E
    L
    E
    V
    A
    T
    E
    
    STEP CONTENT:
    
    1.
    Letter: E
    Title: Empower
    Description: Helping clients discover their God-given strength and identity.
    
    2.
    Letter: L
    Title: Listen
    Description: Creating a safe space where every story is heard with compassion.
    
    3.
    Letter: E
    Title: Equip
    Description: Providing practical, evidence-based tools for lasting change.
    
    4.
    Letter: V
    Title: Validate
    Description: Honoring each person's pain and journey without judgment.
    
    5.
    Letter: A
    Title: Activate
    Description: Mobilizing faith and purpose toward meaningful action and growth.
    
    6.
    Letter: T
    Title: Transform
    Description: Facilitating deep, Spirit-led healing that renews the heart and mind.
    
    7.
    Letter: E
    Title: Establish
    Description: Building resilient foundations for sustained emotional and spiritual health.
    
    STEP STYLING:
    - Arrange all seven steps in one vertical timeline/list.
    - Each circular badge should be approximately 36–42px on desktop.
    - Badge background should be a subtle translucent dark blue/gray.
    - Add a thin muted gold border around each circle.
    - Letter color should be warm muted gold.
    - Titles should use elegant serif typography and be approximately 15–17px.
    - Titles should be white/off-white.
    - Descriptions should be smaller, approximately 10–12px, with muted light-gray/blue coloring.
    - Keep the step spacing tight and refined, matching the reference.
    - The seven circles should visually form a straight vertical line.
    - Add a very subtle vertical connecting line between the circles if possible, using a low-opacity muted gold/gray color.
    - Align the text content vertically with each corresponding circle.
    
    TYPOGRAPHY:
    - Use an elegant editorial serif font for the heading and step titles.
    - Use a clean sans-serif font for descriptions and eyebrow text.
    - Overall typography should feel luxury, spiritual, editorial and professional.
    - Avoid bold/heavy typography.
    
    COLORS:
    - Background overlay: deep navy blue, approximately #173A5E with around 70–80% opacity.
    - Heading/title: #F5F2EA.
    - Body text: muted light gray-blue.
    - Accent gold: approximately #A8954F.
    - Circle borders: muted gold with low opacity.
    
    IMAGE:
    - Make the background image configurable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Add a background image picker.
    - Include an overlay opacity setting so the merchant can adjust the darkness.
    - The background should cover the entire section and remain fixed in appearance without stretching the content.
    
    SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION:
    Add Theme Editor settings for:
    - Background image
    - Overlay color
    - Overlay opacity
    - Section top padding
    - Section bottom padding
    - Content max width
    - Heading size
    - Body text size
    - Circle size
    - Step spacing
    - Accent color
    - Text color
    
    RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR:
    - Desktop: match the reference composition closely, with the heading centered and the seven-step list underneath.
    - Tablet: reduce spacing and typography slightly.
    - Mobile: use 20–24px side padding, left-align the seven-step list, keep the heading centered, and make the circles slightly smaller.
    - Make sure descriptions remain readable and do not become excessively small on mobile.
    - Maintain the premium visual hierarchy on all screen sizes.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    - Match the reference image as closely as 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-elevate-model-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-bg-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-bg-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-bg-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1a3a4a 0%, #0d1f29 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-bg-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    opacity: 0.15;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    font-size: 14px;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.overlay_color }};
    opacity: {{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.content_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_font }}, serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font }}, serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font }}, sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.body_text_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc({{ block.settings.circle_size | divided_by: 2.0 }}px - 0.5px);
    top: {{ block.settings.circle_size | divided_by: 2.0 }}px;
    bottom: {{ block.settings.circle_size | divided_by: 2.0 }}px;
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, 
      {{ block.settings.accent_color }}00 0%, 
      {{ block.settings.accent_color }}40 10%, 
      {{ block.settings.accent_color }}40 90%, 
      {{ block.settings.accent_color }}00 100%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.step_spacing }}px;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.circle_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.circle_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: rgba(30, 58, 94, 0.5);
    border: 1.5px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }}80;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-letter-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font }}, serif;
    font-size: calc({{ block.settings.circle_size }}px * 0.5);
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font }}, serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-elevate-model-step-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font }}, sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_desc_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.step_desc_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-elevate-model-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.65 }}px;
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.body_text_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.circle_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.circle_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-letter-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.circle_size | times: 0.85 }}px * 0.5);
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      left: calc({{ block.settings.circle_size | times: 0.85 | divided_by: 2.0 }}px - 0.5px);
      top: {{ block.settings.circle_size | times: 0.85 | divided_by: 2.0 }}px;
      bottom: {{ block.settings.circle_size | times: 0.85 | divided_by: 2.0 }}px;
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.step_spacing | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.step_title_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-elevate-model-step-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.step_desc_size | times: 0.95 }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
    .ai-elevate-model-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-elevate-model-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-elevate-model-bg-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.background_image %}
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.background_image | image_url: width: 2400 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.background_image.alt | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="{{ block.settings.background_image.width }}"
        height="{{ block.settings.background_image.height }}"
      >
    {% else %}
      <div class="ai-elevate-model-bg-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        <div class="ai-elevate-model-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
